div.p:
Dear ${object.name},
This is a notification regarding your contract with our security services.
% if object.contract_state == 'expiring': Your contract is set to expire on ${format_date(object.contract_end_date)}. Please contact us to discuss renewal options. % elif object.contract_state == 'expired': Your contract has expired on ${format_date(object.contract_end_date)}. Please contact us immediately to avoid any interruption in security services. % endif
Contract Details:
Contract Start Date: ${format_date(object.contract_start_date)}
Contract End Date: ${format_date(object.contract_end_date)}
Contract Status: ${dict(object._fields['contract_state'].selection).get(object.contract_state)}
If you have any questions or would like to discuss renewal options, please don't hesitate to contact us.
Best regards,
Security Management Team

                    Dear Recipient,



                    A gate pass has been issued with the following details:





Gate Pass Number: ${object.name}

Visitor: ${object.visitor_id.name}

Purpose: ${object.purpose or 'N/A'}

Valid From: ${format_datetime(object.valid_from)}

Valid Until: ${format_datetime(object.valid_until)}

Status: ${object.state}



                    Please present this gate pass at the security checkpoint.



                    Best regards,


                    Security Management Team

                    Dear ${object.visitor_id.name},



                    We regret to inform you that your gate pass request has been rejected:





Gate Pass Number: ${object.name}

Purpose: ${object.purpose or 'N/A'}

Requested Date: ${format_date(object.visit_date)}

Status: Rejected



                    % if object.rejection_reason:

Reason for rejection: ${object.rejection_reason}
                    % endif


                    If you have any questions, please contact your host or the security office.



                    Best regards,


                    Security Management Team

                    Dear Recipient,



                    An incident has been reported with the following details:





Incident Number: ${object.name}

Reported By: ${object.reported_by_id.name}

Date & Time: ${format_datetime(object.date)}

Location: ${object.location_id.name if object.location_id else 'N/A'}

Severity: ${object.severity}

Status: ${object.state}



                    Description:

${object.description or 'No description provided.'}


                    Please review the incident report and take appropriate action.



                    Best regards,


                    Security Management Team

                    Dear Recipient,



                    A patrol has been started with the following details:





Patrol Number: ${object.name}

Patrol Officer: ${object.employee_id.name}

Start Time: ${format_datetime(object.start_time)}

Location: ${object.location_id.name if object.location_id else 'N/A'}

Route: ${object.route_id.name if object.route_id else 'N/A'}



                    You will be notified when the patrol is completed.



                    Best regards,


                    Security Management Team
